<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's doubles results at</p>
<p>Wimbledon on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>11-Naoko Kijimuta (Japan)/Nana Miyagi (Japan) beat Anna</p>
<p>Kournikova (Russia)/Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) 4-6 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>Third round:</p>
<p>2-Martina Hingis (Switzerland)/Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain)</p>
<p>beat 15-Chanda Rubin (U.S.)/Brenda Schultz-Mccarthy</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 7-6 (14-12) 6-7 (6-8) 13-11</p>
<p>Els Callens (Belgium)/Ginger Helgeson Nielsen (U.S.) beat</p>
<p>14-Amy Frazier (U.S.)/Kimberly Po (U.S.) 7-6 (7-4) 6-3</p>
<p>5-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.)/Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat 9-Katrina</p>
<p>Adams (U.S.)/Lori McNeil (U.S.) 6-1 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>3-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.)/Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat</p>
<p>13-Alexandra Fusai (France)/Rita Grande (Italy) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>4-Larisa Neiland (Latvia)/Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) beat</p>
<p>10-Nathalie Tauziat (France)/Linda Wild (U.S.) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
